      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b><u>Level Resets:</u></b>

    If the level is failed consecutively
    by all players, it will automatically clear the level.


    <b><u>Level without
    Objects:</u></b>

    If there are no placed objects, the players score less
    points.


    <b><u>All clears:</u></b>

    If there are 3 or more players and
    all of them clear the stage, no points are awarded.'
